  description: 'Gain <color=#FFFFFF>Death Prevention</color>.

    <color=#FFA000>On
    <color=#FFFFFF>Death Prevented</color>:</color> <color=#FFFF00>Berserk Surge</color>.

    <color=#FFA000><color=#FFFF00>Berserk
    Surge</color>:</color> Gain full <color=#FFFF00>Energy</color>, become <color=#FFA000>Invincible</color>
    and enter an <color=#FFA000>uncancellable</color> <color=#FFFF00>Surge</color>.
    <color=#FF00FF>Shield</color> and <color=#FFFFFF>Death Prevention</color> timers
    are paused during this.

    <color=#FFBE50><i>If you already have Death Prevention,
    -25% cooldown.</i></color>'
